B.Qb=s(['My favourite animated film is "Coco". It tells the story of Miguel, a twelve-year-old boy from Mexico who dreams of becoming a musician. The problem is that his family hates music. Many years ago, his great-great-grandfather left the family to follow his dream of music, and he never came back.',"On the Day of the Dead, a special holiday in Mexico, Miguel accidentally enters the Land of the Dead. It is a colourful, magical world full of skeletons, music and lights. There he meets his ancestors and learns the true story of his family.","I love this film because the characters are funny and the songs are beautiful. The soundtrack is my favourite \u2014 I know all the lyrics! But the most important thing is the message: family is the most important thing in life, and we should always remember the people we love.","I'd give this film ten out of ten."],t.s)
